    ('p', 'Install is seven commands, and the scaffold is designed so that the seventh ends with a working, empty app: clone the repository; install dependencies with the lockfile (corepack enable and pnpm install --frozen-lockfile); copy .env.example to .env and set the session passphrase; run prisma migrate deploy to create dev.db; run the seed (creates default settings, starter prompt templates, redaction rules, and fixture stubs); start the app (pnpm dev, or pnpm build and pnpm start for daily use); open localhost:3000 and complete the first-run wizard below. Total time on a fresh machine: about ten minutes, plus model pulls.'),
